Law texts

The texts in this repository are Laws of Lagos State as published in the Lagos State of Nigeria Official Gazette,
taken from the copies the Lagos State Ministry of Justice publishes at lagosstatemoj.org.

- Copyright: the Copyright Act, 2022 (Nigeria), s. 3, says: "The following shall not be eligible for copyright -- ...
  (b) official texts of a legislative or administrative nature as well as any official translations, except their
  compilations". The Laws here are such official texts. The Ministry's website carries a general "All rights reserved"
  footer, which does not reach texts that are not eligible for copyright; no compilation of the Ministry's is copied.
- The Ministry's PDFs are not the authoritative text: the Laws as published in the Lagos State of Nigeria Official
  Gazette are.

Attribution: Source: Lagos State Ministry of Justice, https://lagosstatemoj.org.

